{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "一明體性、二明三界攝不攝"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "《無量壽經》說"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "此自別化一切眾生，非今念佛往生者也。此即處一，見有異也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "何位人得往生"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "修何行業得生淨土"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "此通道俗，《無量\n壽經》意也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "此是《無量清淨\n平等覺經》，與《無量壽經》大同也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "此是《鼓音聲王經》，此明現在未死時則得見佛也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "此是《小阿彌陀經》，七日念佛即得往生也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "此是《大集．賢護菩薩經》，此經中教人想佛必得見也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "此是《往生論》中教人修\n行五念門即得往生。是天親菩薩造也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "此是《起信論》。馬鳴菩薩造此論，教人念佛、發願\n廻向，即得往生也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "此禮讚文，第五引聖教門中具顯。此略\n引三五初門意也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "此依《無量壽經》，三輩往生並云發菩提心也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "《小阿彌陀經》中明七日"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "《鼓音聲王\n經》、《清淨平等覺經》明十日"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "此是《大集．賢護經》中教化眾生"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "依何道理得生淨土。二、問答分別釋妨難"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "聖教者後說，道理者今論"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "謂引經論二教"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "釋曰：此是\n因門"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "謂引道俗得往生人示諸學者"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "比丘僧六人、比丘尼四人、\n優婆塞五人、優婆夷五人"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "云云"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "此是十念往生"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "出《彌勒經》"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "謂今正是懺悔念佛時也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "此是經論大意"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "謂令厭穢欣淨"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "厭門竟"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "欣門竟"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "終"}
